{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_02938","headline":"奉和九月九日登慈恩寺浮图应制 · 崔日用","name":"奉和九月九日登慈恩寺浮图应制","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"紫宸欢每洽，绀殿法初隆。\n菊泛延龄酒，兰吹解愠风。\n咸英调正乐，香梵徧秋空。\n临幸浮天瑞，重阳日再中。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"崔日用","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_02938.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_02938","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}